  "body": {
    "type": "doc",
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Masala dosa serves 4 and takes about 60 minutes plus soaking and fermenting. The batter must ferment for several hours, so plan ahead. Keep the pan at a steady medium heat for crisp dosas."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Wipe the hot pan with a little oil and a cut onion before each dosa so the batter spreads thin."
          }
        ]
      },
